 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                              MASTER SERVICES\nHauptstraße 42, 80331 München, Germany                    AGREEMENT\nUSt-IdNr: DE082361857\n\nVON                                                   RECHNUNGSADRESSE\n\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                          Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG\nHauptstraße 42                                         Berliner Allee 19\n80331 München                                          20095 Hamburg\nGermany                                                Germany\nVAT: DE082361857\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 16.04.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG, with its registered office at Hauptstraße 42, München (\"Party A\"), and\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19, Hamburg (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG / Anna Weber\nParty B   Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG / Hans Schneider\nDate      16.04.2026",
